- `args::Vector{String}` (optional): Additional arguments to append to the configured agent invocation for terminal auth.
- `env::Dict{String,String}` (optional): Additional environment variables to set on the configured agent invocation for terminal auth.
  These values override same-named variables in the base launch configuration.
- `meta::Union{Nothing,Dict{String,Any}}` (optional): The _meta property is reserved by ACP to allow clients and agents to attach additional
  metadata to their interactions. Implementations MUST NOT make assumptions about values at
  these keys.

  See protocol docs: [Extensibility](https://agentclientprotocol.com/protocol/extensibility)
"""
