The request `initialize`, which the agent answers with a [`InitializeResponse`](@ref).
# Fields

- `protocol_version::ProtocolVersion`: The latest protocol version supported by the client.
- `client_capabilities::ClientCapabilities` (optional): Capabilities supported by the client.
